  data: {
    LLM: "Try to play doubles early to create chicken feet and control the board. Get rid of high-pip tiles quickly to minimize points if opponent dominoes. Save tiles that can play on likely doubles.\n\nPay attention to which doubles have been played and which remain. Force opponents to draw by playing doubles when you have tiles to continue the foot. Block opponents by completing chicken feet they can't extend.\n\nSophisticated tile counting to track what opponents hold. Strategic use of doubles to force opponents to pass. Managing hand composition for endgame. Recognizing when to play defensively versus aggressively.",
    Player: "Try to play doubles early to create chicken feet and control the board. Get rid of high-pip tiles quickly to minimize points if opponent dominoes. Save tiles that can play on likely doubles.\n\nPay attention to which doubles have been played and which remain. Force opponents to draw by playing doubles when you have tiles to continue the foot. Block opponents by completing chicken feet they can't extend.\n\nSophisticated tile counting to track what opponents hold. Strategic use of doubles to force opponents to pass. Managing hand composition for endgame. Recognizing when to play defensively versus aggressively.",
